	<row id="msg_0418_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Uh... um. Mic check! 1, 2, 1, 2...\nThis the one and only THE FEDS, baby!\nThree years later and we BACK, we done\nrebuilt the whole squad! We ain’t\nnever leavin’ again! WE BACK!\nGiovanni! You hear this, Big Boss?!\n...We finally did it, bruh!\nWhere Big Boss at though?\nI wonder if he heard us... Wassup?\n</language>
	</row>
